 "description": "Stylish and comfortable, the Flyer 8 SUNdeck displays the character and elegance that typifies this new generation of BENETEAU dayboats. With great livability and panoramic views, it benefits from all BENETEAU's expertise in terms of fixtures and fittings. The ideal host for day excursions, with a comfortable cabin and two sunbeds, an exceptional tour de force for an 8-metre outboard.\nNew: discover the Flyer 8 SUNdeck Pilot Edition.\nLearn more",
