   "intro": "The Flyer 8 SUNdeck has a very comfortable cabin with all the fixtures and fittings needed for enjoyable day trips. Equipped with a benchseat and a table that converts into a large bed, separate toilets and an easily accessible fridge, it offers its passengers a high level of comfort.",
