   "items": [
    {
     "title": "2 SUNBEDS",
     "text": "The convertible aft benchseat and the front sunbed with two reclining seats give the Flyer 8 SUNdeck relaxation areas that are not usually found on an 8-metre speedboat."
    },
    {
     "title": "SMART WALKAROUND",
     "text": "On the port side, the Smart Walkaround gangway allows safe, easy passage on deck."
    },
    {
     "title": "COMFORTABLE CABIN",
     "text": "Well equipped and well ventilated thanks to its openings, the Flyer 8 SUNdeck offers a comfortable space with great livability, ideal for resting at any time of day."
    },
    {
     "title": "WIDE RANGE OF ACCESSORIES",
     "text": "T-top, canvas shade cloth, water-ski pole, fully equipped fishing station (replacing the rear benchseat) the Flyer 8 SUNdeck can be configured to meet all day boating programs."
    }
